Phase 8 — Verifiable Intent

In: Official spec adapter; replace the stub; threats A-G as tests.
Out: Homemade RSA; forking and renaming the reference repo.
Done when: threats A-G fail closed.

Implementation: OfficialIntentVerifier calls published verify_chain and
check_constraints. Production create_app() uses that adapter. VALID is an
auth column only. Replay nonces persist in intent_nonces. Policy
merchant_allowlist is wired for threat B2. Tests mint ephemeral ES256
chains; private keys are not in git.
